#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Kursus IBM percuma mengenai maklumat dan pengiraan kuantum"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pengenalan"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the following video, John Watrous steps you through the content in this lesson on quantum circuits. Alternatively, you can open the [YouTube video](https://youtu.be/30U2DTfIrOU?list=PLOFEBzvs-VvqKKMXX4vbi4EB1uaErFMSO) for this lesson in a separate window. [Download the slides](https://ibm.box.com/public/static/zsd4694uko51kzcohdvbp6ncgl9u9ys3.pdf) for this lesson.\n"
msgstr "Dalam video berikut, John Watrous membimbing anda melalui kandungan pelajaran mengenai litar kuantum ini. Sebagai alternatif, anda boleh membuka [video YouTube](https://youtu.be/30U2DTfIrOU?list=PLOFEBzvs-VvqKKMXX4vbi4EB1uaErFMSO) untuk pelajaran ini dalam tetingkap berasingan. [Muat turun slaid](https://ibm.box.com/public/static/zsd4694uko51kzcohdvbp6ncgl9u9ys3.pdf) untuk pelajaran ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<IBMVideo id=\"134056224\" title=\"In this video, John Watrous describes introduces quantum circuits. He demonstrates how circuits represent quantum operations and builds the connection with matrix operations.\"/>\n"
msgstr "<IBMVideo id=\"134056224\" title=\"Dalam video ini, John Watrous memperkenalkan litar kuantum. Beliau menunjukkan cara litar mewakili operasi kuantum dan membina hubungan dengan operasi matriks.\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This lesson introduces the *quantum circuit* model of computation, which provides a standard way to describe quantum computations.\n"
msgstr "Pelajaran ini memperkenalkan model pengiraan *litar kuantum*, yang menyediakan cara standard untuk menerangkan pengiraan kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The lesson also introduces a few important mathematical concepts, including *inner products* between vectors, the notions of *orthogonality* and *orthonormality*, and *projections* and *projective measurements*, which generalize standard basis measurements.\n"
"Through these concepts, we'll derive fundamental limitations on quantum information, including the *no-cloning theorem* and the impossibility to perfectly discriminate non-orthogonal quantum states.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelajaran ini juga memperkenalkan beberapa konsep matematik penting, termasuk *hasil darab dalaman* antara vektor, konsep *ortogonaliti* dan *ortonormaliti*, serta *unjuran* dan *pengukuran projektif*, yang merupakan generalisasi kepada pengukuran asas standard.\n"
"Melalui konsep-konsep ini, kita akan menerbitkan had-had asas pada maklumat kuantum, termasuk *teorem tiada-pengklonan* dan ketidakmungkinan untuk membezakan keadaan kuantum bukan-ortogon dengan sempurna.\n"
